@Mec126_HostAddress = http://localhost:5130

### List all (default page)
GET {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

###

### Pagination — page 1, 2 items per page
GET {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=2
Accept: application/json

###

### Pagination — page 2
GET {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=2&pageSize=2
Accept: application/json

###

### Sort by price descending
GET {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products?sortBy=price&sortDir=desc
Accept: application/json

###

### Filter + sort + pagination
GET {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products?minPrice=10&sortBy=name&sortDir=asc&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Get by id
GET {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create product
POST {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Headphones",
  "price": 45.99,
  "category": "Tech",
  "description": "Wireless headphones"
}

###

### Validation error — missing name
POST {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 10
}

###

### Validation error — invalid price
POST {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bad Price Item",
  "price": 0
}

###
